The OCR pipeline in src/ is a port of RapidOCR
(https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR, Copyright 2021-2024 SWHL), which in turn
derives from PaddleOCR
(https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR, Copyright 2022 PaddlePaddle Authors).

The ONNX models in models/ are the PP-OCRv3 Chinese text detection, recognition
and direction-classification models, converted and distributed by RapidOCR
under the Apache License 2.0.

  ch_PP-OCRv3_det_infer.onnx            2.32 MB
  ch_PP-OCRv3_rec_infer.onnx           10.20 MB
  ch_ppocr_mobile_v2.0_cls_infer.onnx  0.56 MB

The recognition character dictionary (6623 entries) is embedded in the
recognition model's ONNX metadata and is read at runtime; it is not a separate
file.

